### MODEL (turn 3)
Fixed the single-decimal bug in `ledger/money.py`: `parse_amount` now pads the fractional part to two digits, so `10.5` parses as 1050 cents instead of 1005. The spot checks (`10.5`, `10.50`, `10`, `0.5`, `-3.07`, `1,200.4`) return the expected values, and the 3 existing tests pass. Public names and signatures are unchanged.
